              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJoshuwa wathi kubantu: “Nina ningofakazi ngokumelene nani ukuthi nizikhethele uJehova ukuba nimkhonze. Futhi bathi: “Singofakazi.”",
          "type": "text",
