              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJoshuwa waloba lawa mazwi encwadini yomthetho kaNkulunkulu, wathatha itshe elikhulu, walimisa lapho phansi kwesihlahla somtholo esisendlini engcwele kaJehova.",
