              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJoshuwa wayesethi kubo bonke abantu: “Bhekani, leli tshe liyakuba ngufakazi wethu; ngoba lizwile wonke amazwi eNkosi ewakhulume kithi.",
          "type": "text",
